#: ../../tutorials/first_analysis.md:32
msgid "One channel with sampled values"
msgstr "サンプル値を持つ 1 チャンネル"

#: ../../tutorials/first_analysis.md:32
msgid "A `TimeSeries` returned by `sine` or `gaussian`"
msgstr "`sine` または `gaussian` が返す `TimeSeries`"

#: ../../tutorials/first_analysis.md:32
msgid "Channel list"
msgstr "チャンネル一覧"

#: ../../tutorials/first_analysis.md:32
msgid "`TimeSeriesDict` with keys `\"Sensor A\"` and `\"Sensor B\"`"
msgstr "`\"Sensor A\"` と `\"Sensor B\"` をキーに持つ `TimeSeriesDict`"

#: ../../tutorials/first_analysis.md:32
msgid "Sample rate and segment start"
msgstr "サンプルレートと区間開始時刻"

#: ../../tutorials/first_analysis.md:32
msgid "`sample_rate=512` and `t0=0`"
msgstr "`sample_rate=512` と `t0=0`"

#: ../../tutorials/first_analysis.md:32
msgid "Engineering unit"
msgstr "工学単位"

#: ../../tutorials/first_analysis.md:32
msgid "`unit=\"V\"` attached to every channel"
msgstr "各チャンネルに付ける `unit=\"V\"`"

#: ../../tutorials/first_analysis.md:32
msgid "Time selection"
msgstr "時間選択"

#: ../../tutorials/first_analysis.md:32
msgid "`channels.copy().crop(0, 1)`"
msgstr "`channels.copy().crop(0, 1)`"

#: ../../tutorials/first_analysis.md:32
msgid "FFT length and overlap"
msgstr "FFT 長とオーバーラップ"

#: ../../tutorials/first_analysis.md:32
msgid "`fftlength=2`, `overlap=1`, both in seconds"
msgstr ""
"`fftlength=2` と `overlap=1`。\n"
"いずれも秒単位"

#: ../../tutorials/first_analysis.md:32
msgid "ASD traces"
msgstr "ASD トレース"

#: ../../tutorials/first_analysis.md:32
msgid "`channels.asd(...).plot()`"
msgstr "`channels.asd(...).plot()`"

#: ../../tutorials/first_analysis.md:32
msgid "Save plot"
msgstr "図の保存"

#: ../../tutorials/first_analysis.md:32
msgid "`plot.savefig(\"asd.png\")`"
msgstr "`plot.savefig(\"asd.png\")`"

#: ../../tutorials/first_analysis.md:110
msgid ""
"Here `t0=0` is a convenient synthetic origin. For recorded GW data, `t0` usually "
"represents a GPS timestamp in seconds. Crop bounds use the same coordinate as the "
"channel's start time; for a channel starting at GPS `t0`, select its first second "
"with `.crop(t0, t0 + 1)`."
msgstr ""
"ここでは合成データの便宜的な原点として `t0=0` を使います。\n"
"記録した GW データでは、通常 `t0` は秒単位の GPS 時刻を表します。\n"
"切出し範囲はチャンネルの開始時刻と同じ座標を使います。\n"
"GPS 時刻 `t0` に始まるチャンネルの最初の 1 秒は、`.crop(t0, t0 + 1)` で選択できます。"

#: ../../tutorials/first_analysis.md:114
msgid "Try a controlled change"
msgstr "条件を 1 つずつ変える"

#: ../../tutorials/first_analysis.md:116
msgid ""
"Change the sine frequency from 40 Hz to 70 Hz, rerun the file, and inspect `asd.png`."
" The shared spectral feature should move to 70 Hz. Restore 40 Hz, then change only "
"Sensor B's `std` from 0.8 to 0.3. The two broadband floors should become comparable, "
"while the independently seeded noise traces remain different."
msgstr ""
"正弦波の周波数を 40 Hz から 70 Hz に変え、ファイルを再実行して `asd.png` を確認します。\n"
"共通のスペクトルのピークが 70 Hz に移るはずです。\n"
"40 Hz に戻し、Sensor B の `std` だけを 0.8 から 0.3 に変えます。\n"
"広帯域フロアは同程度になりますが、シードが独立しているためノイズの線は一致しません。"

